{"id":"u07","kelas":7,"no":7,"judul":"Hobi dan Kemampuan","title":"Hobbies and Abilities","emoji":"⚽","ringkas":"can/can't dan like + kata kerja-ing","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut berbagai hobi dan olahraga","mengatakan suka atau tidak suka: [[like]], [[love]], [[enjoy]], [[don't like]], [[hate]]","memakai bentuk **kata kerja-ing** setelah like, love, dan enjoy","menyatakan kemampuan dengan [[can]] dan [[can't]]","bertanya: [[What's your hobby?]] dan [[Can you ...?]]","memakai [[play]], [[go]], dan [[do]] dengan benar"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Apa kegiatan favoritmu saat libur? Bermain bola, menggambar, atau membaca? Di **Unit 7** kamu belajar bercerita tentang **hobi** dan **kemampuan**, dua topik yang paling seru saat berkenalan dengan teman baru."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Hobi (Hobbies)","items":[{"en":"reading","id":"membaca","ex":"I like reading comics."},{"en":"drawing","id":"menggambar","ex":"She enjoys drawing."},{"en":"singing","id":"bernyanyi","ex":"He loves singing."},{"en":"dancing","id":"menari","ex":"They like dancing."},{"en":"cooking","id":"memasak","ex":"My mother enjoys cooking."},{"en":"swimming","id":"berenang","ex":"I like swimming."},{"en":"riding a bicycle","id":"bersepeda","ex":"We love riding a bicycle."},{"en":"playing games","id":"bermain game","ex":"He likes playing games."},{"en":"listening to music","id":"mendengarkan musik","ex":"I enjoy listening to music."},{"en":"taking photos","id":"memotret","ex":"She likes taking photos."},{"en":"gardening","id":"berkebun","ex":"My grandfather likes gardening."},{"en":"collecting stamps","id":"mengoleksi perangko","ex":"He enjoys collecting stamps."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Olahraga (Sports)","items":[{"en":"football","id":"sepak bola","ex":"I play football."},{"en":"badminton","id":"bulu tangkis","ex":"She plays badminton."},{"en":"basketball","id":"bola basket","ex":"They play basketball."},{"en":"volleyball","id":"bola voli","ex":"We play volleyball."},{"en":"table tennis","id":"tenis meja","ex":"He plays table tennis."},{"en":"running","id":"lari","ex":"I go running on Sunday."},{"en":"swimming","id":"berenang","ex":"We go swimming."},{"en":"martial arts","id":"bela diri","ex":"She does martial arts."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Mengungkapkan suka dan tidak suka","text":"Dari yang paling suka sampai paling tidak suka:","table":[["Ungkapan","Artinya","Contoh"],["[[love]]","sangat suka","[[I love singing.]]"],["[[like]] / [[enjoy]]","suka / menikmati","[[She likes drawing.]] / [[He enjoys cooking.]]"],["[[don't like]]","tidak suka","[[I don't like running.]]"],["[[hate]]","benci / sangat tidak suka","[[He hates getting up early.]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[What's your hobby?]] — [[My hobby is reading.]]","id":"Apa hobimu? — Hobiku membaca."},{"en":"[[What do you like doing?]] — [[I like riding a bicycle.]]","id":"Kamu suka melakukan apa? — Aku suka bersepeda."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Setelah like, love, dan enjoy: kata kerja + -ing","text":"Setelah **like**, **love**, **enjoy**, **hate**, kata kerja diberi akhiran **-ing**. Bentuk ini disebut **gerund** (kata kerja yang berfungsi seperti kata benda).","table":[["Kata kerja","+ ing","Contoh"],["read","reading","[[I like reading.]]"],["swim","swimming","[[She loves swimming.]] (m digandakan)"],["run","running","[[He enjoys running.]] (n digandakan)"],["dance","dancing","[[They like dancing.]] (e dihilangkan)"],["ride","riding","[[We love riding a bike.]] (e dihilangkan)"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Aturan menambah -ing","text":"• Kata kerja biasa: tambah **-ing** (read → reading).\n• Berakhiran **e**: hilangkan e, lalu **-ing** (dance → dancing).\n• Satu suku kata dengan pola konsonan-vokal-konsonan: **gandakan** konsonan terakhir (swim → swimming, run → running)."},{"t":"warn","title":"Jangan lupa -s untuk he/she/it","text":"Kata **like** tetap mengikuti aturan simple present: [[She likes drawing.]] Bukan *She like drawing*. Tetapi kata kerja kedua memakai **-ing**, bukan -s."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Can dan can't: menyatakan kemampuan","text":"**Can** = bisa / mampu. **Can't** (can not) = tidak bisa. Setelah can kata kerja memakai **bentuk dasar**, tanpa to dan tanpa -s, untuk semua subjek.","table":[["Bentuk","Contoh"],["Positif","[[I can swim.]] / [[She can sing.]]"],["Negatif","[[I can't swim.]] / [[He can't ride a bicycle.]]"],["Pertanyaan","[[Can you swim?]] — Yes, I can. / No, I can't."]],"examples":[{"en":"[[Can she play the guitar?]] — [[Yes, she can.]]","id":"Bisakah dia bermain gitar? — Ya, bisa."}]},{"t":"warn","title":"Can tidak pernah ditambah -s","text":"Benar: [[She can sing.]] Salah: *She cans sing* atau *She can sings*. Setelah can, kata kerjanya selalu bentuk dasar."},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Play, go, atau do?","text":"Kita memakai kata kerja yang berbeda untuk kegiatan berbeda:","table":[["Kata kerja","Dipakai untuk","Contoh"],["**play**","olahraga dengan bola, permainan, alat musik","[[play football]], [[play badminton]], [[play the guitar]], [[play games]]"],["**go**","kegiatan yang berakhiran -ing","[[go swimming]], [[go running]], [[go fishing]]"],["**do**","kegiatan tanpa bola atau tim","[[do martial arts]], [[do yoga]], [[do homework]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Hobi dan kemampuan","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"What's your hobby, Tom?","id":"Apa hobimu, Tom?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"I love playing football. I play it every Sunday.","id":"Aku suka sekali bermain sepak bola. Aku main setiap hari Minggu."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Wow! Can you play basketball, too?","id":"Wow! Bisakah kamu bermain basket juga?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"No, I can't. But I can swim very fast. How about you?","id":"Tidak bisa. Tapi aku bisa berenang sangat cepat. Kalau kamu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"I like drawing and singing. I can draw cartoons!","id":"Aku suka menggambar dan bernyanyi. Aku bisa menggambar kartun!"}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Suka: [[love]] > [[like / enjoy]] > [[don't like]] > [[hate]] + kata kerja-**ing**.","Aturan -ing: [[dance → dancing]], [[swim → swimming]], [[read → reading]].","[[Can]] + kata kerja dasar (tanpa -s, tanpa to). Negatif: [[can't]].","**play** + olahraga bola/alat musik, **go** + kata kerja-ing, **do** + kegiatan lain."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan hobi dengan artinya:","pairs":[["reading","membaca"],["drawing","menggambar"],["cooking","memasak"],["swimming","berenang"],["singing","bernyanyi"]],"exp":"Hobi biasanya berbentuk kata kerja-ing.","k":"bf2190b4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku suka membaca.","q":"I like ___. (read)","answers":["reading"],"hint":"read + ing","exp":"Setelah like: kata kerja + -ing → reading.","k":"abcd82b0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia suka menari.","q":"She likes ___. (dance)","answers":["dancing"],"hint":"dance → danc + ing","exp":"Berakhiran e: hilangkan e → dancing.","k":"202f11fc"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami suka berenang.","q":"We love ___. (swim)","answers":["swimming"],"hint":"swim → swimm + ing","exp":"Gandakan m: swimming.","k":"0442b93c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She like drawing.","She likes drawing.","She likes draw.","She liking drawing."],"answer":1,"exp":"She → likes, lalu kata kerja berikutnya pakai -ing: drawing.","k":"6a2948d6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang artinya \"benci\"?","options":["love","like","hate","enjoy"],"answer":2,"exp":"hate = benci.","k":"4c9925ad"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["He cans swim.","He can swims.","He can swim.","He can to swim."],"answer":2,"exp":"can + kata kerja dasar. Tanpa -s dan tanpa to.","k":"f389543d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku tidak bisa menyanyi.","q":"I ___ sing.","answers":["can't","cannot","can not"],"hint":"can / can't ?","exp":"tidak bisa = can't.","k":"224ca68b"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Bisakah kamu bermain gitar?\"","answer":"Can you play the guitar?","exp":"Can + subjek + kata kerja dasar.","k":"b840cfd1"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Hobiku bermain sepak bola.\"","answer":"My hobby is playing football.","exp":"My hobby is + kata kerja-ing.","k":"c87e0135"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban singkat yang benar untuk \"Can she swim?\" (bisa) adalah...","options":["Yes, she can.","Yes, she cans.","Yes, she does.","Yes, she is."],"answer":0,"exp":"Can she ...? → Yes, she can.","k":"acaf1778"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata kerja yang tepat: \"I ___ badminton on Saturday.\"","options":["go","do","play","make"],"answer":2,"exp":"olahraga dengan bola/raket → play.","k":"353b184b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata kerja yang tepat: \"We ___ swimming every Sunday.\"","options":["play","go","do","have"],"answer":1,"exp":"kegiatan -ing → go swimming.","k":"ff0f9de6"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang dia suka?","say":"He enjoys collecting stamps","options":["Dia suka mengoleksi perangko","Dia suka bermain game","Dia suka memotret","Dia suka berkebun"],"answer":0,"exp":"collecting stamps = mengoleksi perangko.","k":"db186d0f"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pertanyaannya?","say":"What do you like doing","options":["Kamu suka melakukan apa?","Apa pekerjaanmu?","Kamu bisa apa?","Apa hobi ayahmu?"],"answer":0,"exp":"like doing = suka melakukan.","k":"27341eb8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"I hate getting up early\" artinya...","options":["Aku suka bangun pagi.","Aku benci bangun pagi.","Aku bisa bangun pagi.","Aku tidak bisa bangun pagi."],"answer":1,"exp":"hate = benci.","k":"703fb6dd"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan hobi dengan artinya:","pairs":[["playing games","bermain game"],["listening to music","mendengarkan musik"],["taking photos","memotret"],["gardening","berkebun"],["dancing","menari"]],"exp":"Hobi.","k":"cea27545"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan olahraga dengan artinya:","pairs":[["badminton","bulu tangkis"],["volleyball","bola voli"],["basketball","bola basket"],["table tennis","tenis meja"],["football","sepak bola"]],"exp":"Olahraga.","k":"eb3e1b6a"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kerja dengan bentuk -ing:","pairs":[["swim","swimming"],["dance","dancing"],["cook","cooking"],["run","running"],["write","writing"]],"exp":"Aturan -ing.","k":"6d36d4a9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I love cooking.","I love cook.","I love to cooking.","I love cooks."],"answer":0,"exp":"love + kata kerja-ing.","k":"d732cca3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["He enjoys listening to music.","He enjoy listening to music.","He enjoys listen to music.","He enjoys to listening music."],"answer":0,"exp":"He → enjoys + listening.","k":"fba11eda"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["They can play badminton.","They cans play badminton.","They can plays badminton.","They can to play badminton."],"answer":0,"exp":"can + kata kerja dasar.","k":"ab73b6ea"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She can't swim.","She cannot swims.","She can't to swim.","She don't can swim."],"answer":0,"exp":"can't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"93002036"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["Can you sing?","Do you can sing?","Can you to sing?","You can sing?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Can + subjek + kata kerja dasar?","k":"596bf618"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata kerja yang tepat: \"My brother ___ table tennis.\"","options":["plays","goes","does","makes"],"answer":0,"exp":"Olahraga dengan bola/raket → play; he → plays.","k":"04d42d17"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata kerja yang tepat: \"They ___ fishing on Sunday.\"","options":["go","play","do","make"],"answer":0,"exp":"go fishing.","k":"28544096"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata kerja yang tepat: \"She ___ yoga every morning.\"","options":["does","plays","goes","has"],"answer":0,"exp":"do yoga; she → does.","k":"bee1dd59"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku suka berenang.","q":"I like ___. (swim)","answers":["swimming"],"hint":"swim → swimm + ing","exp":"Gandakan m.","k":"d3491786"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia suka memasak.","q":"She likes ___. (cook)","answers":["cooking"],"hint":"cook + ing","exp":"cook → cooking.","k":"c4d4ac5e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku bisa bermain gitar.","q":"I ___ play the guitar.","answers":["can"],"hint":"c _ _","exp":"can = bisa.","k":"9e686ee3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia tidak bisa menyetir.","q":"He ___ drive.","answers":["can't","cannot","can not"],"hint":"can't","exp":"can't = tidak bisa.","k":"a552f918"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku suka bermain bulu tangkis.\"","answer":"I like playing badminton.","exp":"like + kata kerja-ing.","k":"c697dc18"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia tidak suka berlari.\"","answer":"She doesn't like running.","exp":"doesn't like + kata kerja-ing.","k":"9c976644"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apa hobimu?\"","answer":"What's your hobby?","exp":"What's your hobby?","k":"e0ac413f"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa hobinya?","say":"My hobby is taking photos","options":["Memotret","Menggambar","Berenang","Menari"],"answer":0,"exp":"taking photos = memotret.","k":"4cbdd6e1"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa kemampuannya?","say":"I can play the piano","options":["Bisa bermain piano","Tidak bisa bermain piano","Suka bermain piano","Sedang bermain piano"],"answer":0,"exp":"can = bisa.","k":"19aa0dc0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"My name is Dina. I love drawing and singing. I can draw cartoons. I can't play football.\" Apa yang tidak bisa dilakukan Dina?","options":["Bermain sepak bola","Menggambar kartun","Bernyanyi","Menggambar"],"answer":0,"exp":"can't play football.","k":"2d501356"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Tom likes swimming. He goes swimming every Sunday. He can swim very fast.\" Kapan Tom berenang?","options":["Setiap hari Minggu","Setiap hari Senin","Setiap malam","Setiap pagi"],"answer":0,"exp":"every Sunday.","k":"433a2c85"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"My sister enjoys cooking. She can cook fried rice and noodles.\" Apa yang bisa dimasak adik?","options":["Nasi goreng dan mi","Kue dan roti","Sup dan ikan","Telur dan ayam"],"answer":0,"exp":"fried rice and noodles.","k":"0d1269f2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"What's your hobby?\" B: \"___\"","options":["My hobby is reading.","I can swim.","I am from Bali.","It's Sunday."],"answer":0,"exp":"hobby.","k":"1681c619"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Can you play the guitar?\" B: \"No, I ___. But I can play the piano.\"","options":["can't","don't","isn't","not"],"answer":0,"exp":"Can you ...? → No, I can't.","k":"847ecd6a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["She likes to swimming.","She likes swimming.","She likes to swim.","She loves swimming."],"answer":0,"exp":"like to swim atau like swimming.","k":"36586280"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["He can plays football.","He can play football.","She can play football.","They can play football."],"answer":0,"exp":"can + kata kerja dasar.","k":"9de4ad94"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I enjoy to listen to music.","I enjoy listening to music.","I like listening to music.","I love music."],"answer":0,"exp":"enjoy + -ing.","k":"43bc9f5c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Aku bisa berenang tetapi tidak bisa menyelam\" adalah...","options":["I can swim but I can't dive.","I can swim but I don't can dive.","I swim can but dive can't.","I cans swim but not dive."],"answer":0,"exp":"can; can't.","k":"5050d823"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Dia suka menggambar\" adalah...","options":["She likes drawing.","She like drawing.","She likes draw.","She is like drawing."],"answer":0,"exp":"likes + -ing.","k":"5a6bc3b2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["guitar","football","badminton","volleyball"],"answer":0,"exp":"guitar = alat musik; lainnya olahraga.","k":"d20e88dd"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku suka bernyanyi.","q":"I like ___. (sing)","answers":["singing"],"hint":"sing + ing","exp":"singing.","k":"5ef99e50"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia bisa bermain piano.","q":"She ___ play the piano.","answers":["can"],"hint":"c _ _","exp":"can.","k":"4d82b96e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami suka berkebun.","q":"We like ___. (garden)","answers":["gardening"],"hint":"g _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"gardening.","k":"cc925706"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka tidak bisa menyetir.","q":"They ___ drive.","answers":["can't","cannot","can not"],"hint":"can't","exp":"can't.","k":"80ce54ac"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Hobiku adalah menggambar.\"","answer":"My hobby is drawing.","exp":"My hobby is + kata kerja-ing.","k":"013a7809"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Bisakah dia berenang?\"","answer":"Can he swim?","exp":"Can + he + kata kerja dasar?","k":"6ede4889"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa hobinya?","say":"He loves riding a bicycle","options":["Bersepeda","Berenang","Menggambar","Memasak"],"answer":0,"exp":"riding a bicycle = bersepeda.","k":"d3fe1ef6"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang tidak bisa dia lakukan?","say":"She can't swim","options":["Berenang","Menari","Bernyanyi","Memasak"],"answer":0,"exp":"can't swim.","k":"55281475"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Temanmu bertanya, \"What do you like doing in your free time?\" Kamu suka membaca komik. Jawabanmu?","options":["I like reading comics.","I can reading comics.","I likes read comics.","I like to reads comics."],"answer":0,"exp":"like + -ing.","k":"9eeaa734"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Seseorang bertanya, \"Can you play the guitar?\" Kamu tidak bisa. Jawabanmu?","options":["No, I can't.","No, I don't.","No, I'm not.","No, I haven't."],"answer":0,"exp":"can't.","k":"9d8d8a5c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["swimming","swiming","swimmming","swiming's"],"answer":0,"exp":"swimming.","k":"e0742e9b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["badminton","badmington","batminton","badmintone"],"answer":0,"exp":"badminton.","k":"12099a41"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["dancing","danceing","dancening","dansing"],"answer":0,"exp":"dancing.","k":"3aa996e8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is your hobby?\" (Bermain b